ways friendly and cordial. Food came out timely and efficiently. OVERALL ======== One of my favorite places ..."},{"business_id":"Tkk0A_p70hfMUAVLtYrdQQ","review_id":"wubeWGItciGQPBV-7d1EIg","date":"2020-02-16T04:37:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9368479251861572,"text_excerpt":"My go to spot for seafood in the wank! Everything is solid. I normally go for crawfish and a shrimp poboy :) Service is fast."},{"business_id":"Tkk0A_p70hfMUAVLtYrdQQ","review_id":"2v4epR-AGIU7HpPiZSpfVA","date":"2016-02-17T14:59:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9209046959877014,"text_excerpt":"My go to place for crawfish. Be prepared to stand in line and maybe wait because they sell so much crawfish that you sometimes have to wait for a new batch to cook. Ok by me cuz it's worth the wait!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Tkk0A_p70hfMUAVLtYrdQQ","photo_id":"0q0HZjsY9vNIp55FrP1P6A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/0q0HZjsY9vNIp55FrP1P6A.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
